  "_approach": "The long filter-and-percussion build: a percussion loop (conga/clave/shaker) starts sparse in bar 1 and gains hits every bar while a companion low-pass filter sweep (automate separately) opens toward the drop; the closed hat layers in from bar 2, the kick stays a steady 4/4 throughout (techno's build keeps dancing rather than stopping), and a rising shaker density plus offbeat open hats carry the final bar into the drop. This is the 8-32 bar EDMProd-style filter build compressed to 4 bars of programmed density.",
